	And I create a team with the name "Koroneiki Partner" for the account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}"
	And I assign the team with the name "Koroneiki Partner" on the account "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" to the following roles
	| Partner |
	And I assign contacts with the following email addresses to the team "Koroneiki Partner"
	| pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And I update a koroneiki contact with the email address "pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken" to have the following values
	| Email Address Verified | false |
	And I log into the provisioning homepage as "test@liferay.com" with password "kwSgiajslgb7ecsD"
	And I search the accounts page using the keyword "Korpro"
	And I click on the account with the name "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" on the provisioning index
	And I click on the "Contacts" tab
	Then I should be able to view the contact with the email address "pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken" and the following values
	| Name          | PRO Koroneiki1                       |
	| Email Address | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Role          | Support Watcher                      |
	| User Status   | UNVERIFIED                           |
	When I click on the "Liferay Workers" tab
	Then I should not be able to view the worker with the email address "pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken"

Scenario: View and search multiple contacts
	Testing the ability to create several contacts in Dossiera and koroneiki and viewing the respective contacts in the provisioning account details page

	Given I generate several static variables for Provisioning
	And I generate a provisioning company name
	And I generate a provisioning project name
	And I publish a project with no partner RabbitMQ message with routing key "dossiera.provisioning.create" with the following values
	| Account Name                           | Prokor - ${staticCompanyName}              |
	| Address City                           | Diamond Bar                                |
	| Address Country                        | United States                              |
	| Address Postal Code                    | 91765                                      |
	| Address Region                         | California                                 |
	| Address Street                         | 456 Fake Street                            |
	| Contact Email Address                  | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken       |
	| Contact First Name                     | PRO                                        |
	| Contact Last Name                      | Koroneiki1                                 |
	| Dossiera Account Key                   | ${staticDossieraAccountKey}                |
